  'Appleton Enclave is located at Olomowewe area of the Free Trade Zone, in close proximity to the Dangote Refinery, Deep Sea Port, and other notable mega-developments. It is a very serene location with beautiful residential ambience, featuring Certificate of Occupancy (C of O) title, 100% dry table land, well-paved road network, constant electricity, portable water, armed security personnel, children play area, and lavish greenery.',
