  '{"area":"1,000 – 5,000 SQM","landType":"Heavy-Duty Dry Ground","titleType":"Certificate of Occupancy (C of O)"}'::jsonb,
  'Appleton Commercial & Residences in the Origanrigan Area of Ibeju Lekki by the Free Trade Zone. Prime C of O serviced parcels with central gas powered system, warehouses & storage, wide heavy-duty roads, and residential zoning.',
  'Appleton Commercial & Residences is a signature master development by CAIH Group located in the strategic Origanrigan area of Ibeju Lekki, adjacent to the Lekki Free Trade Zone and Dangote Refinery corridor. Fully certified with a sovereign Certificate of Occupancy (C of O), the project offers 1,000 SQM, 2,000 SQM, and 5,000 SQM development parcels engineered with heavy-duty roadways, central gas-powered systems, 24/7 CCTV surveillance, perimeter fencing, integrated warehouse and storage facilities, and designated residential quarters.',
  ARRAY['Land Title: Certified Certificate of Occupancy (C of O)', 'Strategic Location: Origanrigan Area of Ibeju Lekki by Free Trade Zone', 'Central Gas Powered System Infrastructure', '24/7 Surveillance Camera Security Coverage', 'Full Perimeter Fencing with Monitored Gate Access', 'Wide and Heavy-Duty Road Networks Engineered for Logistics', 'Integrated Warehouses and Storage Facilities', 'Master-Planned Dedicated Residential Area Partition', 'Immediate Physical Allocation & Cadastral Beacon Demarcation'],
